Package: vabaxos-ctl
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, libglib2.0-bin, apt, gpg, vabaxos-update, vabaxos-accessibility
Description: vabaxctl, VabaxOS from the terminal
 One command for the state of VabaxOS, in short answers a screen reader
 reads well: version, screen reader, voice, VabaxOS archive and updates;
 it also changes the voice and turns the screen reader on or off, and
 starts the update and the report of the computer. Italian command
 names too: stato, voce, lettore, aggiorna, rapporto, archivio.
